{"id": "P1", "arm": "H-self.esc", "model": "local_smart", "effort": "low", "valid": true, "void": null, "grade": "correct", "answer": "6 months from termination (i.e., by August 2026). Although clause 5.2 of the Agreement (as reinstated by AMD-3) provides a 24-month retention period, the Side Letter (SIDE-1, para 1) provides that where the Client's Data Retention and Procurement Policy imposes a stricter requirement on the retention or deletion of Client personal data, the Policy prevails. Policy P-4.2 requires deletion within 6 months of termination, which is stricter, and therefore governs.", "attempt": 1, "ts": "2026-09-24T14:00:28+0100", "content": "ANSWER: 6 months from termination (i.e., by August 2026). Although clause 5.2 of the Agreement (as reinstated by AMD-3) provides a 24-month retention period, the Side Letter (SIDE-1, para 1) provides that where the Client's Data Retention and Procurement Policy imposes a stricter requirement on the retention or deletion of Client personal data, the Policy prevails. Policy P-4.2 requires deletion within 6 months of termination, which is stricter, and therefore governs.\nCITATION: SIDE-1 para 1; POL-3.1 P-4.2", "reasoning_chars": 2833, "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 860, "prompt_tokens": 3607, "total_tokens": 4467, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "wall_s": 88.59, "tokens": null, "overlap": false, "slot_samples": 85, "slot_errors": 0}
{"id": "P1", "arm": "H-lp.esc", "model": "local_smart", "effort": "low", "valid": true, "void": null, "grade": "correct", "answer": "6 months from termination. The Side Letter (SIDE-1, para 1) provides that where the Client's Data Retention and Procurement Policy imposes a stricter requirement on retention or deletion of Client personal data, the Policy prevails over the Agreement. The Policy (POL-3.1, P-4.2) requires deletion within 6 months of termination, which is stricter than the 24-month period reinstated by AMD-3 (para 1). The 6-month period therefore governs.", "attempt": 1, "ts": "2026-09-24T14:01:55+0100", "content": "ANSWER: 6 months from termination. The Side Letter (SIDE-1, para 1) provides that where the Client's Data Retention and Procurement Policy imposes a stricter requirement on retention or deletion of Client personal data, the Policy prevails over the Agreement. The Policy (POL-3.1, P-4.2) requires deletion within 6 months of termination, which is stricter than the 24-month period reinstated by AMD-3 (para 1). The 6-month period therefore governs.\nCITATION: SIDE-1 para 1; POL-3.1 P-4.2; AMD-3 para 1", "reasoning_chars": 2704, "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 831, "prompt_tokens": 3607, "total_tokens": 4438, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "wall_s": 86.05, "tokens": null, "overlap": false, "slot_samples": 82, "slot_errors": 0}
